{"id": "22-4366-2-20", "zh": "650. disa 可替换为 passa、dassa、dasa、da、dakkha［ka.471；rū.483；nī.951］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4367-2-17", "zh": "disa 词根可以选择性地替换为 passa、dassa、dasa、da、dakkha 这几种形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4368-2-39", "zh": "例如：vipassanā（内观）、vipassī bhagavā（毗婆尸世尊）、sudassī、piyadassī、atthadassī、dhammadassī、sudassaṃ vajjamaññesaṃ（别人的过失容易看见）［法句252］、sudassananagaraṃ（善见城）、mahāsudassano nāma rājā（名叫大善见的国王）［长部2.242］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4369-2-47", "zh": "dasa 替换形的例子：catusaccaddaso nātho（照见四谛的怙主）［分别论义注·经分别注］、duddaso dhammo（难以见到的法）［大品7；长部2.64］、attano pana duddasaṃ（自己的过失却难以看见）［法句252］、so ve bhikkhu dhammadasoti vuccati（这样的比丘才称为见法者）［出处待查］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4369-48-54", "zh": "passa dhammaṃ durājānaṃ, sammuḷhettha aviddasū（看哪，这难以了知的法，无知的人在这里迷惑）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4369-55-60", "zh": "daṭṭhabbaṃ、daṭṭhā、daṭṭhuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4370-2-42", "zh": "依这条规则，disa 在所有语尾中视情况替换为 passa、dassa、dakkha，在 ā、ī 等语尾中替换为 dasa、da；至于 dissati、dissanti 这些形式，是 ya 经前音同化后，在这里用于被动，在 divādi 类中则用于主动。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4370-43-48", "zh": "依大规则，也有 addassa、dissa 这两种替换形。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4370-49-152", "zh": "这方面的圣典用例有：yaṃ vāsavaṃ addassāmaṃ［本生1.6.112；‘addasāma’］、ye mayaṃ bhagavantaṃ addassāma（我们这些见过世尊的人）［出处待查］、api me mātaraṃ adassatha（你们见过我的母亲吗）［中部2.356］、dissanti bālā abyattā（可以看到愚昧无知的人）［大品82］、mayi ime dhammā sandissanti, ahañca imesu dhammesu sandissāmi（这些法在我身上可以看到，我也在这些法中可以看到）［中部3.253］、nimittāni padissanti, tāni ajja padissare（那些征兆显现了，今天它们显现了）［佛种姓2.82］。所以在 ti 等语尾中，adassati、adassanti、adassasi、adassatha、adassāmi、addassāma 这些形式也是成立的。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-4371-2-17", "zh": "使役 ṇi 语缀中用 dassa 替换形：dasseti、dassayati、nidasseti、nidassayati、sandasseti、sandassayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4372-2-17", "zh": "被动：dassīyati、dassīyanti、nidassīyati、nidassīyanti、sandassīyati、sandassīyanti、dakkhati、dakkhanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4373-2-5", "zh": "被动：dakkhīyati、dakkhīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4374-2-12", "zh": "依“gamayamisāsadisānaṃ cchaṅa”规则替换为 ccha 时：dicchati、dicchanti 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4375-2-17", "zh": "passati、passanti、dakkhati、dakkhanti、passīyati、passīyanti、dakkhīyati、dakkhīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4376-2-22", "zh": "ya 经前音同化时：dissati、dissanti、dissate、dissante、uddissate、uddissante、niddissate、niddissante、apadissate、apadissante。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4377-2-9", "zh": "使役：passāpeti、passāpayati、dakkhāpeti、dakkhāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4378-2-11", "zh": "被动：passāpīyati、dassīyati、nidassīyati、sandassīyati、dakkhāpīyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4379-2-18", "zh": "passatu、passantu、dakkhatu、dakkhantu、passeyya、passeyyuṃ、dakkheyya、dakkheyyuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4380-2-9", "zh": "eyyāma 可变为 emu，词末的 a 也可变为 u。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-4380-10-45", "zh": "圣典有“kattha passemu khattiyaṃ（我们在哪里能见到那位刹帝利）［本生2.2.1947］、dakkhemu te nivesanaṃ（我们想看看你的住处）［本生1.15.254（…nivesanāni）］”。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4380-46-53", "zh": "passeyyāma、passeyyāmu、dakkheyyāma、dakkheyyāmu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4381-2-5", "zh": "ā 等语尾中：apassā、adakkhā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4382-2-46", "zh": "在 dasa、da 替换形中，d 音重复：addasā kho bhagavā（世尊看见了）［大品9；长部2.69；相应部1.159］、addasā kho āyasmā ānando（尊者阿难看见了）［中部1.364］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4383-2-17", "zh": "元音变短时：tamaddasa mahābrahmā, nisinnaṃ samhi vesmani（大梵天看见他坐在自己的屋里）［本生1.16.148］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4383-18-20", "zh": "te addasū（他们看见了）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4383-21-45", "zh": "元音变短时：addasu；āmantayassu vo putte, mā te mātaramaddasu（去召唤你的孩子们吧，免得他们见不到母亲）［本生经作“āmantayassu te putte, mā te mātara maddasuṃ”］。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "22-4384-2-4", "zh": "da 替换形：so addā（他看见了）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4385-2-3", "zh": "元音变短时：adda。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4385-4-19", "zh": "yāyamāno mahārājā, addā sīdantare nage（大王一路前行，看见了悉陀河之间的群山）［本生2.22.2105］。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-4385-20-36", "zh": "yo dukkhaṃ sukhato adda, dukkhamaddakkhi sallato（他把苦看作乐，又把苦看作箭）［长部2.368］。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "22-4386-2-29", "zh": "ī 等语尾中：apassi、passi、apassī、passī、apassiṃsu、passiṃsu、apassi、passi、apassittha、passittha、apassiṃ、passiṃ、apassimhā、passimhā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4387-2-17", "zh": "dassa 替换形：addassi、addassuṃ、addassiṃsu、addassaṃsu、addassi、addassittha、addassiṃ、addassimhā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4388-2-6", "zh": "dakkha 替换形：adakkhi、dakkhi 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4389-2-10", "zh": "dasa 替换形在偈颂中：addasi、addasuṃ、addasiṃsu、addasaṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4390-2-12", "zh": "在另一组语尾中：addasā、addasū、ahaṃ addasaṃ、mayaṃ addassimhe。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-4390-13-30", "zh": "addasaṃ kāma te mūlaṃ, saṅkappā kāma jāyasi（欲啊，我看见了你的根源；欲啊，你从思念而生）［本生1.8.39］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4391-2-17", "zh": "有时在加 s 增音时还加 ā 增音：so addasāsi、te addasāsuṃ、ahaṃ addasāsiṃ、mayaṃ adasāsimha。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4391-18-29", "zh": "yaṃ addasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, desentaṃ dhammamuttamaṃ（当我看见正等觉者宣说无上的法）［长老偈287］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4391-30-39", "zh": "athaddasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, satthāramakutobhayaṃ（于是我看见了正等觉者，那位无所畏惧的导师）［长老偈912］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4392-2-19", "zh": "依大规则，iṃ 变为 imhi：pathe addasāsimhi bhojaputte（我在路上看见了猎人的儿子们）［本生2.17.146］。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4393-2-5", "zh": "ssati 等语尾中：passissati、passissanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4394-2-22", "zh": "dakkha 替换形依“dakkha sakkha hehi”等规则删去 ssa：dakkhati、dakkhanti、dakkhiti、dakkhinti、dakkhissati、dakkhissanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4395-2-6", "zh": "ssā 等语尾中：apassissā、adakkhissā 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4396-2-7", "zh": "mara，义为舍弃生命：marati、maranti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4397-2-25", "zh": "依“jaramarānamiyaṅa”规则替换为 iya：miyati、miyanti；amhaṃ daharā na miyyare（我们家的年轻人不会夭折）［本生1.10.97］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4398-2-25", "zh": "使役中依“assā ṇānubandhe”规则 a 增长为 ā：māreti、mārenti、mārayati、mārayanti、mārāpeti、mārāpenti、mārāpayati、mārāpayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4399-2-7", "zh": "yamu，义为止息：yamati、yamanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4399-8-15", "zh": "pare ca na vijānanti, mayamettha yamāmase（别人不明白：我们在这里终将死去）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4399-16-27", "zh": "这里 yamāmase 的意思是：我们停止，我们走向死亡。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4400-2-8", "zh": "前加 saṃ 时表示自制：saṃyamati、saṃyamanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4401-2-6", "zh": "鼻音 ṃ 替换为 ñ 时：saññamati、saññamanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4402-2-9", "zh": "前加 ni 时表示限定：niyamati、niyamanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4403-2-14", "zh": "依“gamayamisāsadisānaṃ vā cchaṅa”规则，m 替换为 ccha：niyacchati、niyacchanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4404-2-5", "zh": "被动：niyamīyati、niyamīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4405-2-5", "zh": "前音同化时：niyammati、niyammanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4406-2-5", "zh": "使役：niyāmeti、niyāmayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4407-2-12", "zh": "ṇāpi 语缀中不增长元音：niyamāpeti、niyamāpayati，意思是确定。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4408-2-7", "zh": "ruda，义为流泪：rodati、rodanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4409-2-29", "zh": "ssati 等语尾中，依“labhavasachidagamabhidānaṃ cchaṅa”规则，d 连同 ssa 一起替换为 ccha：sā nūna kapaṇā ammā, cirarattāya rucchati（那可怜的母亲想必会长久地哭泣）［本生2.22.2136］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4409-30-45", "zh": "koñjī samuddatīreva, kapaṇā nūna rucchati（她想必会像海边的雌鹭一样可怜地哭泣）［本生2.21.113］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4409-46-82", "zh": "sā nūna kapaṇā ammā, ciraṃ rucchati assame（那可怜的母亲想必会在净修林里长久地哭泣）［本生2.22.2138］；kaṃ nvajja chātā tasitā, uparucchanti dārakā（今天孩子们又饿又渴，会向谁哭诉呢）［本生2.22.2153］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4409-83-90", "zh": "rodissati、rodissanti、rucchati、rucchanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4410-2-9", "zh": "ssā 等语尾中：arucchā、arucchaṃsu、arodissā、arodissaṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4411-2-27", "zh": "ruha，义为到达：ruhati、ruhanti、āruhati、āruhanti、ārohati、ārohanti、abhiruhati、abhiruhanti、oruhati、oruhanti、orohati、orohanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4412-2-3", "zh": "被动：ārohīyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4413-2-15", "zh": "依“hassa vipallāso”规则，h 与 ya 互换位置：āruyhati、oruyhati。", "confidence": 80}
